{"id":"b5b8f3d84579602d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete.md","title":"thm-vertex-cover-np-complete (VERTEX-COVER is NP-Complete)","display":"thm-vertex-cover-np-complete (VERTEX-COVER is NP-Complete)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-independent-set]]","[[28-df-vertex-cover]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-independent-set-np-complete]]"],"display":"thm-vertex-cover-np-complete (VERTEX-COVER is NP-Complete)","label":"28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete","VERTEX-COVER is NP-complete","Vertex Cover NP-completeness"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5\" href=\"?note=9b48ca7c5c96f8c5\" title=\"28-df-independent-set\">28-df-independent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17335df21f7731bf\" href=\"?note=17335df21f7731bf\" title=\"28-df-vertex-cover\">28-df-vertex-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a93b83e8c9de9da6\" href=\"?note=a93b83e8c9de9da6\" title=\"28-thm-independent-set-np-complete\">28-thm-independent-set-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vertex-cover-np-complete (VERTEX-COVER is NP-Complete)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete</span><span>VERTEX-COVER is NP-complete</span><span>Vertex Cover NP-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IS}\">\\(\\mathrm{IS}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\">\\(\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V\">\\(S\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le k\\le|V|\">\\(0\\le k\\le|V|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17335df21f7731bf\" href=\"?note=17335df21f7731bf\" title=\"28-df-vertex-cover\">28-df-vertex-cover</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{IS}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{IS}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\ne v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\notin E)\\right)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(V\\setminus S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\ne v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\notin E)\\right)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(V\\setminus S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\in\\mathrm{IS}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,|V|-k)\\in\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(G,k)\\in\\mathrm{IS}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,|V|-k)\\in\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le|V|\">\\(k\\le|V|\\)</span> 取补集并把阈值改成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|V|-k\">\\(|V|-k\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;|V|\">\\(k&gt;|V|\\)</span>，独立集实例必为否，映到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_2\">\\(K_2\\)</span> 的零阈值覆盖；无效语法也映到该否例，避免自然数相减越界与归约部分定义。检查覆盖的证据是顶点子集。旧稿只给合法实例上的图变换却称作总函数，现总性由这两个分支明确补全。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.15及提示；印刷65、532页；PDF91、558页。题目陈述已核对；补集证明为本地展开。</p>\n<p>R6依赖证据复核：补集归约已复核，完整NP难性依赖IS/3SAT的受限证明。本地推导记录保留；完整结论当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-independent-set","status":"resolved","id":"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-independent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-vertex-cover","status":"resolved","id":"17